# Multiverse

# Multiverse — One limitless space for every idea.

**Multiverse** is an ambitious, open-source, cross-platform creative workspace designed to bring ideas, creativity, engineering, and intelligent tools together in one limitless environment.

Inspired by the flexibility of infinite-canvas applications, Multiverse aims to provide a powerful workspace for sketching, technical drawing, visual thinking, diagramming, brainstorming, and professional design.

Built around a high-performance Rust core, Multiverse combines a vector-first canvas, precision drawing tools, GPU-accelerated rendering, customizable brushes, document management, and a modern user interface.

Beyond traditional drawing applications, Multiverse is designed with extensibility and intelligent workflows in mind. It will feature an integrated AI agent supporting multiple providers, including OpenAI and Anthropic, alongside a command-line interface (CLI) and Model Context Protocol (MCP) server for automation, external integrations, and programmatic control.

### Core vision

To create a versatile, extensible, and intelligent digital workspace where users can think, design, draw, visualize, organize, and develop ideas without the limitations of a traditional canvas.

### Planned capabilities

- Infinite, high-performance canvas.
- Vector-based drawing and geometry tools.
- Freeform sketching and customizable brushes.
- Precision grids, guides, snapping, and measurements.
- Layers, object manipulation, and transformations.
- Advanced GPU-accelerated rendering.
- Import and export for common creative and technical file formats.
- AI-powered assistance and brainstorming.
- OpenAI and Anthropic provider support.
- CLI for automation and document operations.
- MCP server for AI and external application integrations.
- Extensible plugin architecture.
- Cross-platform support for Linux, Windows, macOS, Android, and iOS.

### Technology

- **Core:** Rust
- **Desktop UI:** Iced
- **Rendering:** wgpu (planned)
- **AI:** OpenAI and Anthropic integrations
- **Automation and interoperability:** CLI and MCP

Multiverse is being developed as an independent open-source project, with a long-term vision of becoming a comprehensive creative and technical workspace.
